    "updated_at": "2026-07-01T08:06:29Z",
    "body": "I think we should define the kind of lengths etc we can resolve without an element (which I think is basically what `DOMMatrix` uses), and use it by default in most these places where things are used out of band.\n\nIf some of these places need relative units / element-dependent values like `sibling-index()` etc then they should be defined way more precisely, including when exactly do they get evaluated and re-evaluated.",
